MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add three key mechanisms inspired by Codex CLI /goal:

1. Token budget tracking: optional token_budget, tokens_used, time_used
2. Anti-laziness: 0 tool calls in continuation turns → auto-pause after 3
3. Wrap-up steering: 90% budget consumed → graceful finish prompt

GoalState gains 6 new fields. evaluate_after_turn accepts tool_calls_count
and tokens_used. All 26 existing tests pass. Backward compatible.
